8t9m4AHG1Fk_C908qcO3dxobuH2hA6ERg&oe=6AA699DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "copertina video.png", "id": "934904885770722", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_934904889104055_7789558022625798828_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y_FkiPK8poIQ7kNvwEQbOTG&_nc_oc=AdqQscrd5W0NIa-CwzZywIH2KPqQunO4zVtbD-IkN2ZooKV3mCEHjUIm-Sjs8pN7vFg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIN1RPf1gAI9GdApd9ChfXz3sTQ7-3lhSULVce1Bl6ucQ&oe=6AA6C5AE"}, "display_name": "Material Exploratory", "keywords": ["university", "material", "recycling", "sustainability", "innovation"], "long_description": "Material Exploratory is a research-based Mixed Reality experience developed by Universit\u00e0 Iuav di Venezia in collaboration with Metagate. It proposes a new model of interactive material library, designed to make circular materials accessible through immersive exploration.\n\nThe project focuses on innovative materials produced in North-East Italy through reuse, recycling and waste transformation processes. Each sample is presented as a narrative object, connected to its origin, industrial supply chains, destination sectors and territorial networks. Material consultation becomes an active and engaging journey, bridging industry, research and education.\n\nUsers can interact with digital material samples through natural hand gestures, picking them up virtually and activating layered content structured in three environments: Past, dedicated to documentation and material biographies; present, conceived as an immersive storytelling space; and future, oriented toward teaching and design research.\nThe experience is enhanced by sound design, featuring a gender-neutral text-to-speech voice and audio elements mapped to material characteristics.\nMaterial Exploratory is a scalable platform supporting new forms of material awareness and circular innovation. Special thanks to Alisea, Favini, Rehub and Tecnica Group for their collaboration and shared contents.", "short_description": "Material Exploratory is a research-based material library experience developed by Universit\u00e0 Iuav di Venezia and Metagate. Explore circular materials from North-East Italy, created via reuse, recycling and waste transformation processes, through an immersive interactive experience. Touch, discover and learn the stories, origins, supply chains and territorial connections behind innovative material samples, turning material consultation into an active and engaging journey."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://discover.themetagate.it/pages/privacy-policy-material-exploratory", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Metagate", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.iuav.it/it/eventi/material-exploratory", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["it"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26441731288765379"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1963274344569259"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1963274344569259"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1774436400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1963274344569259"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26500341139571060", "version": "8.5"}, "id": "13393020